cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "BoliviaSatellites: Bilingual Municipal Satellite and Environmental Data Platform for Bolivia (339 Municipalities)"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Leiva
    given-names: Favio
repository-code: "https://github.com/Favioleiva/BoliviaSatellites"
url: "https://github.com/Favioleiva/BoliviaSatellites"
license: MIT
date-released: "2026-11-24"
abstract: >-
  Bilingual (Spanish/English) scientific web platform for seven municipal
  satellite and environmental products over 339 Bolivian municipalities
  (ERA5-Land, GPM IMERG V07, HKU NTL, MODIS MCD64A1, MODIS MOD13Q1, SatPM PM2.5,
  and NASA Black Marble). Newly authored code and documentation are released
  under the MIT License; third-party satellite datasets and cartography retain
  their respective licenses and terms.
